# Ductective — environment template
#
# ⚠️  THIS FILE IS TRACKED BY GIT. Placeholders only — never real values.
#     Real keys go in `.env`, which is gitignored. See .gitignore:11-12.
#
# The split below enforces acceptance criterion 3 in .pipeline/00-brief.md:
# no API key may be present in the client bundle.
#
# Expo inlines any var prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ into the shipped app bundle.
# Anything without that prefix stays server-side and must be set as a
# Supabase Edge Function secret, not read from this file at runtime.
# Run A may rename these — if it does, it updates this file too.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client-safe (ships in the app bundle — anon key is RLS-protected by design)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Origin only. No trailing path — supabase-js appends /rest/v1 itself.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-side only (Edge Function secrets — must never reach the client)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bypasses row-level security. Treat as a database root password.
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# console.anthropic.com — set a monthly spend limit on the account.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# voyageai.com — embeddings for the knowledge base.
VOYAGE_API_KEY=
